blocks.en:
This section formalizes captioning as a tightly coupled engineering system comprising four core components:
(1) a semantic contract specifying what to describe and how to express it;
(2) a multi-expert production pipeline that distills complex signals into a deployable student model;
(3) conjunctive acceptance criteria for assessing caption usability; and
(4) downstream validation protocols that determine whether improved captions translate into better generation.

blocks.zh:
本节将标题正式确定为一个由四个核心部分组成的紧密结合的工程系统:
(1) 语义合同,规定如何描述和表达;
(2) 多专家生产管道,将复杂的信号分解成可部署学生模式;
(3) 评估标题可用性的连带接受标准;以及
(4)确定改进后的标题是否转化为更好的生成的下游验证协议.
